---
import AdminNav from '../../components/AdminNav.astro';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Roadmap - GLP1 Admin</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      color: #1e293b;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .admin-layout { margin-left: 260px; min-height: 100vh; }
    .page-header {
      background: white;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    }
    .page-header h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; }
    .page-header p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #64748b; margin-top: 0.25rem; }
    .main { padding: 2rem; max-width: 1000px; }

    .phase {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .phase-header {
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .phase-title {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .phase-badge {
      padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .badge-done { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
    .badge-active { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
    .badge-planned { background: #f1f5f9; color: #64748b; }

    .phase-body { padding: 0 1.5rem 1.25rem; }

    .task-list { list-style: none; }
    .task-item {
      padding: 0.6rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }
    .task-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .task-check {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }
    .check-done { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
    .check-active { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
    .check-todo { background: #f1f5f9; color: #94a3b8; }

    .task-label { flex: 1; }
    .task-label strong { color: #0f172a; }
    .task-detail { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #64748b; margin-top: 0.15rem; }

    .cron-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
      background: #f3e8ff;
      color: #7c3aed;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .objective {
      background: #fffbeb;
      border: 1px solid #fde68a;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #92400e;
    }
    .objective strong { color: #78350f; }

    .feedback-section {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .feedback-title { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .feedback-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .feedback-card {
      padding: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .feedback-card h4 { font-size: 0.88rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
    .feedback-card p { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.5; }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .admin-layout { margin-left: 0; padding-top: 56px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .main { padding: 1rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<script>
  if (!sessionStorage.getItem('admin_auth')) {
    window.location.href = '/admin/login/';
  }
</script>

<AdminNav />

<div class="admin-layout">
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>Roadmap — Site Auto-Gere</h1>
    <p>Plan de developpement vers un site GLP-1 France entierement autonome</p>
  </div>

  <div class="main">
    <div class="objective">
      <strong>Objectif final :</strong> Un site qui s'autogere — cree du contenu, trouve des opportunites SEO, verifie les faits, corrige les erreurs. L'humain approuve les decisions strategiques.
    </div>

    <!-- PHASE 1 -->
    <div class="phase">
      <div class="phase-header">
        <span class="phase-title">Phase 1 — Fondations</span>
        <span class="phase-badge badge-done">Terminee</span>
      </div>
      <div class="phase-body">
        <ul class="task-list">
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-done">&#10003;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Securite admin</strong> — Mot de passe hashe + auth guard toutes pages
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-done">&#10003;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Agent SEO Opportunity Finder</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Detecte les lacunes de contenu via Claude + web search <span class="cron-badge">Mercredi 8h</span></div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-done">&#10003;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Agent Content Creator</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Genere des articles complets a partir des opportunites approuvees <span class="cron-badge">Quotidien 12h</span></div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-done">&#10003;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Dashboards SEO + Content Creator</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Approbation des opportunites, pipeline de contenu, logs agents</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-done">&#10003;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Table Supabase seo_opportunities</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Migration executee, RLS configuree</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-done">&#10003;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Notifications agent</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">GitHub Step Summary + email apres chaque run</div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PHASE 2 -->
    <div class="phase">
      <div class="phase-header">
        <span class="phase-title">Phase 2 — Intelligence & Monitoring</span>
        <span class="phase-badge badge-planned">A venir</span>
      </div>
      <div class="phase-body">
        <ul class="task-list">
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-todo">&#8226;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Google Search Console API</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Connecter GSC pour mesurer l'impact reel des articles generes (impressions, clics, positions)</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-todo">&#8226;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Dashboard analytique centralise</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Vue unique : articles crees, trafic genere, score fact-check, cout API</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-todo">&#8226;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Auto-approbation des opportunites low-risk</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Les opportunites a faible risque (enrichissement, FAQ) sont auto-approuvees</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-todo">&#8226;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>A/B testing de titres</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Generer 2-3 variantes de titres, mesurer le CTR via GSC</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-todo">&#8226;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Budget tracker automatique</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Suivi en temps reel des tokens consommes et du cout API par agent</div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PHASE 3 -->
    <div class="phase">
      <div class="phase-header">
        <span class="phase-title">Phase 3 — Monetisation</span>
        <span class="phase-badge badge-planned">A venir</span>
      </div>
      <div class="phase-body">
        <ul class="task-list">
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-todo">&#8226;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Agent Affiliation Optimizer</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Analyse les pages a fort trafic, optimise le placement des produits affilies</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-todo">&#8226;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Conversion tracking</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Mesurer les clics affilies par article, optimiser les CTA</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-todo">&#8226;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Newsletter automatisee</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Envoi hebdomadaire aux abonnes avec les derniers articles generes</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-todo">&#8226;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Landing pages dynamiques</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Pages de comparaison auto-generees (Ozempic vs Wegovy, etc.)</div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PHASE 4 -->
    <div class="phase">
      <div class="phase-header">
        <span class="phase-title">Phase 4 — Autonomie Totale</span>
        <span class="phase-badge badge-planned">Vision</span>
      </div>
      <div class="phase-body">
        <ul class="task-list">
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-todo">&#8226;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Agent Teams (Claude Opus)</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Orchestration multi-agents : un planifie, un redige, un verifie, un deploie</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-todo">&#8226;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Self-healing</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Detection et correction automatique des erreurs 404, liens casses, images manquantes</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="task-item">
            <div class="task-check check-todo">&#8226;</div>
            <div class="task-label">
              <strong>Expansion multi-niche</strong>
              <div class="task-detail">Dupliquer le modele sur d'autres niches sante (ex: probiotiques, complements)</div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Feedback channels -->
    <div class="feedback-section">
      <div class="feedback-title">Comment tu recois du feedback</div>
      <div class="feedback-grid">
        <div class="feedback-card">
          <h4>GitHub Actions</h4>
          <p>Apres chaque run d'agent, un rapport apparait dans l'onglet <strong>Actions</strong> de ton repo. Clique sur un run pour voir le Step Summary avec les metriques.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feedback-card">
          <h4>Email (si configure)</h4>
          <p>Configure <code>SMTP_*</code> et <code>ALERT_EMAIL_TO</code> dans GitHub Secrets pour recevoir un email apres chaque run.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feedback-card">
          <h4>Dashboards Admin</h4>
          <p>Les pages <a href="/admin/seo/">/admin/seo/</a> et <a href="/admin/content-creator/">/admin/content-creator/</a> montrent l'etat en temps reel.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feedback-card">
          <h4>Supabase agent_logs</h4>
          <p>Chaque agent ecrit dans <code>agent_logs</code> : statut, duree, tokens, erreurs. Visible dans les dashboards.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
